### Create Internship
POST http://localhost:3000/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Infosys",
  "role": "Software Development Intern",
  "location": "Pune",
  "stipend": 15000,
  "duration": "3 Months",
  "mode": "Hybrid",
  "status": "Open",
  "skills": "Java, SQL, REST API",
  "description": "Software development internship for students.",
  "application_url": "https://example.com/apply"
}

### Update Internship
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/internships/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Infosys",
  "role": "Full Stack Developer Intern",
  "location": "Pune",
  "stipend": 18000,
  "duration": "3 Months",
  "mode": "Hybrid",
  "status": "Open",
  "skills": "Java, Node.js, SQL, REST API",
  "description": "Updated software development internship.",
  "application_url": "https://example.com/apply"
}

### Get All Internships
GET http://localhost:3000/api/internships

### Delete Internship
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/internships/1